### Case: item-route-templated — GET /orders/{orderId}.
### Send several DISTINCT ids so the analytics templating check has data:
###   for id in a1 b2 c3 d4 e5; do curl -s {{GATEWAY}}/orders/$id; done
### They must aggregate to ONE row grouped by route_id (not one row per id).
GET {{GATEWAY}}/orders/a1
accept: application/json
